(191, 88, 'USER', 'What is Artificial Intelligence?', NULL, '2026-11-03 07:00:37'),
(192, 88, 'AI', '**Artificial Intelligence (AI)** is the branch of computer science dedicated to creating systems capable of performing tasks that typically require human intelligence. These tasks include reasoning, problem-solving, understanding natural language, visual perception, and decision-making.\n\n• **Key Branches**: Machine Learning (learning from data), Natural Language Processing (understanding text/speech), Computer Vision (interpreting images/video), and Robotics (autonomous physical actions).\n• **Modern AI**: Driven by deep neural networks, Large Language Models (LLMs), and Small Language Models (SLMs) that power intelligent assistants, recommendation engines, and autonomous systems.', NULL, '2026-11-03 07:00:37'),
